Before sources are complete byte copies under before/. The original Git index is preserved losslessly as before/index.raw.gz; index-preservation.json records full-stream CRC/EOF, original byte SHA/size and mode/owner/ns. Decompress only into a fresh independent review destination and verify that SHA/size before use. Never overwrite an active Git index as part of this handoff. Final seven files are selected by final-r2/source-freeze-r2.json: six immutable fullfiles reuse final/files/, while the changed release test uses final-r2/files/. Initial/extra-image/TAR-tail RED source tuples and all attempt stdout/stderr/receipts remain retained. This package is host-tool development evidence, not a clean SDK/ARM/OCI/HIL qualification.
